description: Require task ID prefix in commit messages
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commit Message Task ID Prefix

- Prefix every commit message with a task ID.
- Use the format `<TASK-ID>: <message>`.
- Example: `{{TICKET_PREFIX}}-127: avoid updating updated_at during revalidation claim`.
- Do not create commits without a task ID prefix unless the user explicitly asks for an exception.
